message: "If you use or reference this project, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "The HLD Handbook: Open-Source High-Level Design Curriculum"
abstract: >-
  An open-source High-Level Design and System Design handbook containing
  159 teaching chapters across 12 parts plus a 22-page trade-offs library
  (181 total pages, approximately 772,000 words). Covers everything from
  networking prerequisites to LLM serving architectures, with 719 Mermaid
  diagrams and 3,100+ citations to primary sources.
